:["Western"],"id":2901,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Gone Are the Days","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk42/shows/5e9ca03d-3485-474b-8be6-95becc51bd3d.png","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk42/shows/31b96281-ca2d-4e9d-a8b7-1b703a871bf2.png","likes":7,"dislikes":3,"views":3719,"release_date":"1521158400000","length":6000,"description":"1908. In the fading twilight of the Old West, Taylon Flynn, a once feared outlaw now forgotten and rendered obsolete by the passage of time, wastes away in virtual anonymity on a decrepit ranch. Unable to reconcile the man he was with the man he has become, he summons an old accomplice for one last ride in a desperate attempt to seek redemption for the error of his ways; a daughter he abandoned, a friend he left for dead, and a wife brutally murdered for his crimes. Determined to extract his revenge with boots on and guns blazing, Taylon's vengeance ride is quickly derailed by the ruthless boss of a dying mining town and a legendary lawman harboring a dark secret. With his last chance at redemption rapidly escaping, Taylon must confront the inner demons he purged long ago and truly atone for his past sins in order to save his soul and the one thing in life that he truly loves.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":5.1}],"value":5.1,"age":"R"},"episode_id":2901,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}